 errores que arruinan la rentabilidad.\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607083206968-13611e3d76db?w=1200\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-07-08\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-07-08\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"Shopifree\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"Vender mas\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"cupones\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"promociones\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"marketing\" data-seo=\"1\">\n    <meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"ventas\" data-seo=\"1\">","root":"<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Cupones y Promociones que Sí Venden (y las que Solo te Hacen Perder Plata)\",\"description\":\"Cómo usar cupones de descuento en tu tienda online sin regalar tu margen. Qué promociones funcionan, cuándo lanzarlas y los errores que arruinan la rentabilidad.\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607083206968-13611e3d76db?w=1200\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-08\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-08\",\"articleSection\":\"Vender mas\",\"keywords\":\"cupones, promociones, marketing, ventas\",\"wordCount\":743,\"inLanguage\":\"es\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Shopifree\",\"url\":\"https://shopifree.app\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Shopifree\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://shopifree.app/newlogo.png\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://shopifree.app/es/blog/cupones-y-promociones-que-si-venden\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position